        "text": "Now you can see that Bitcoin has some unique features, but how is it useful? People have been using Bitcoin, which has been nicknamed digital gold, as an alternative investment to diversify their portfolio and to make purchases and payments. Bitcoin is especially appealing for international remittance. On May 22, 2010, a Bitcoin enthusiast spent 10,000 Bitcoin to buy two large pizzas. Back then, 10,000 Bitcoin was worth around $40. Today it would be worth hundreds of millions of dollars. That day when the first real world Bitcoin transaction took place on May 22 is celebrated as Bitcoin Pizza Day.",
